The '''''Yellow Ace''''' was a [[Starship|ship]] [[pilot]]ed by [[Bo Keevil]], who performed stunts and tricks while flying it. It was a complex ship to fly, and had wings that could shift into a variety of configurations.<ref name="Databank" /> Keevil often crashed the ship.<ref name="Aces">{{SW|url=news/meet-the-aces-in-a-new-star-wars-resistance-featurette|text=Meet the Aces in a New ''Star Wars Resistance'' Featurette}}</ref>

{{Ship-stub}}

==Behind the scenes==
In an earlier version of the script for the ''[[Star Wars Resistance]]'' episode "[[Dangerous Business]]," [[Jarek Yeager]]'s crew worked on the ''Yellow Ace''. Artwork showing the ship's interior engine sections was developed, but was changed to the ''[[Fireball]]'' instead in the episode's final script draft.<ref name="Original Role">{{SW|url=news/buckets-list-extra-6-fun-facts-from-dangerous-business-star-wars-resistance|text=Bucket's List Extra: 6 Fun Facts from "Dangerous Business" - ''Star Wars Resistance''}}</ref>

